# Delivery archives. These are packaged from the tracked sources for handoff
# when pushing to this remote is unavailable, so committing them would store a
# second, drifting copy of content that is already under version control.
# Rebuild with:
#   tar czf SKETCH-DESIGN-PRODUCTION-EXECUTION-V2.tar.gz \
#       SKETCH_DESIGN_PRODUCTION_EXECUTION_MASTER_V2.md execution
*.tar.gz

# Python bytecode from execution/_tools and EXECUTION_BLUEPRINT/_tools
__pycache__/
*.pyc
